{"app": "Ju's Corner", "version": 1, "data": {"garden": {"g006zogdl": {"body": "• shadowing\n• watch a video a day", "createdAt": 1795388255929, "kind": "lista", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["idiomas"], "title": "languages", "updatedAt": 1795388255929, "url": ""}, "g001d0ags": {"body": "• cute snack plates\n• waking up, writting, reading, going to the balcony\n• exploring my own city", "createdAt": 1795388260929, "kind": "lista", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["rotina"], "title": "things to do to feel more alive", "updatedAt": 1795388260929, "url": ""}, "g036e7qts": {"body": "", "createdAt": 1795388225929, "kind": "link", "stage": "semente", "tags": ["articles"], "title": "I'm 38. If You're in Your 20's or 30's, Read This.", "updatedAt": 1795388225929, "url": "https://timdenning.substack.com/p/im-38-if-youre-in-your-20s-or-30s?r=4ysug5&utm_campaign=post&utm_medium=web"}, "g01157cpk": {"body": "• LP customized", "createdAt": 1795388250929, "kind": "ideia", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["presentes"], "title": "gift ideas", "updatedAt": 1795388250929, "url": ""}, "g02595vnp": {"body": "", "createdAt": 1795388236929, "kind": "link", "stage": "semente", "tags": ["cool websites"], "title": "The Victorian Web: Linking Scholarship, Teaching and Learning since 1994", "updatedAt": 1795388236929, "url": "https://victorianweb.org/"}, "g041hd9te": {"body": "• some kind of heaven\n• ren faire\n• the python hunt\n• caterpillar", "createdAt": 1795388220929, "kind": "filme", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["documentários"], "title": "documentaries", "updatedAt": 1795388220929, "url": ""}, "g014656q2": {"body": "", "createdAt": 1795388247929, "kind": "ideia", "stage": "semente", "tags": ["para pesquisar"], "title": "look up jonathan haidt ethical dilemas", "updatedAt": 1795388247929, "url": ""}, "g017u4q5e": {"body": "• list 1 - brain dump, every little thing\n• list 2 sections, make little boxes\n• plan the week", "createdAt": 1795388244929, "kind": "conselho", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["organização"], "title": "how to be more organized with lists", "updatedAt": 1795388244929, "url": ""}, "g010lf5gs": {"body": "cool question: adult boarding school: you can pick where the school is, you're gonna be there for a year. you can pick 3 topics to study, and you will leave 100% professional.", "createdAt": 1795388251929, "kind": "pensamento", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["cool questions"], "title": "adult boarding school", "updatedAt": 1795388251929, "url": ""}, "g023ttsps": {"body": "", "createdAt": 1795388238929, "kind": "link", "stage": "semente", "tags": ["cool websites"], "title": "Home | Romantic Circles", "updatedAt": 1795388238929, "url": "https://romantic-circles.org/"}, "g009vs4o9": {"body": "• clean your screenshots\n• clean notes app\n• unsubscribe email list\n• delete unused apps", "createdAt": 1795388252929, "kind": "lista", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["rotina"], "title": "reset tips", "updatedAt": 1795388252929, "url": ""}, "g0395omm9": {"body": "• have a conversation with someone that is smarter than you\n• pick a topic you know nothing about, explain it to yourself outloud (badly), until you can do it well\n• watch a documentary about something that has nothing to do with my job\n• pick a problem in the world nobody has ever solved yet and try to solve it on paper (you won't)\n• read the diaries of dead people", "createdAt": 1795388222929, "kind": "lista", "stage": "flor", "tags": ["aprender"], "title": "hobbies to make you smarter", "updatedAt": 1795388222929, "url": ""}, "g029jaxe2": {"body": "artists to get to know", "createdAt": 1795388232929, "kind": "arte", "stage": "semente", "tags": ["artists to get to know"], "title": "Lucia Laguna", "updatedAt": 1795388232929, "url": "https://fdag.com.br/artistas/lucia-laguna/"}, "g034je52q": {"body": "• good socks (Calzedonia)", "createdAt": 1795388227929, "kind": "lista", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["compras"], "title": "things to buy to be more grown-up", "updatedAt": 1795388227929, "url": ""}, "g007vxt0w": {"body": "• having more enterntening stuff in my bag\n• read a classic novel and pair it with a theory book with the same themes\n• one film a week\n• to build personal curriculum read something: you want to learn more about, you know nothing about, matches the feeling of the season, short.", "createdAt": 1795388254929, "kind": "lista", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["rotina", "leitura"], "title": "things to do", "updatedAt": 1795388254929, "url": ""}, "g020kzijn": {"body": "", "createdAt": 1795388241929, "kind": "link", "stage": "semente", "tags": ["cool websites"], "title": "Cocktails — TypingMind", "updatedAt": 1795388241929, "url": "https://www.bubbbly.com/cocktails"}, "g013lzr23": {"body": "• am I the god or the devotee?\n• am i the alter or the offering?\n• am i the hero or the damsel?\n• am i the hunter or the prey?\n• if someone took i bite of my soul, what would it taste like? what magical power would it offer?\n• write out a user manual for others to help understand you\n• invent a religion/belief/that feels healing. add rituals, sacred places, objects\n• what am i trying to recreate every time i fall in love with a book/film/song?\n• describe the exact kind of attention i've been longing for lately. not “love\", be specific\n• if you stopped trying to be someone interesting, who would you wanna be naturally?\n• when was the last time i felt calm? describe the day and events", "createdAt": 1795388248929, "kind": "prompt", "stage": "flor", "tags": ["journaling"], "title": "Journaling prompts", "updatedAt": 1795388248929, "url": ""}, "g035y98zp": {"body": "• colocar as aulas da valéria em um dvd\n• fazer mais coisas sozinha\n• escrever e estudar as obras que eu tenho que estão em um cartão postal", "createdAt": 1795388226929, "kind": "lista", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["desejos"], "title": "coisas que eu quero fazer", "updatedAt": 1795388226929, "url": ""}, "g012g5xvn": {"body": "• trace one motif across the museum: color, theme…\n• imagine what it would be like to be in the artwork\n• write a review of the exibt in your head\n• name all the things you see in the paiting\n• close up and far away\n• assembling your collection - and what are you trying to say in that exibt", "createdAt": 1795388249929, "kind": "lista", "stage": "flor", "tags": ["arte", "museu"], "title": "at the museum", "updatedAt": 1795388249929, "url": ""}, "g008h183l": {"body": "• immaterial - the met\n• the rest is history\n• stuff you should know", "createdAt": 1795388253929, "kind": "referência", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["podcast"], "title": "podcasts", "updatedAt": 1795388253929, "url": ""}, "g004ywk7n": {"body": "• Fazenda catuçaba\n• Mira\n• Quinta dos Pinhais\n• Fazenda Santa Vitória\n• Botanique", "createdAt": 1795388257929, "kind": "lugar", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["places", "viagem"], "title": "Hotéis", "updatedAt": 1795388257929, "url": ""}, "g0225q9qm": {"body": "", "createdAt": 1795388239929, "kind": "link", "stage": "semente", "tags": ["cool websites"], "title": "A24 — Films", "updatedAt": 1795388239929, "url": "https://a24.raviklaassens.com/"}, "g0278pof1": {"body": "", "createdAt": 1795388234929, "kind": "link", "stage": "semente", "tags": ["cool websites"], "title": "web-altar.xyz", "updatedAt": 1795388234929, "url": "https://web-altar.xyz/?a=ufgltgwb5u"}, "g01607jgu": {"body": "• if you don't take photos when having a good time, it's a sacrifice to time itself. time will be please and you'll get more of that in the future\n• write down a question on paper, and the answer will come to you in a fortnight. often, much sooner.\n• if you hold a beautiful object in your hands when you feel happy and energized, it will store some of that energy, and will give it back to you when you need it the most\n• let the colors you wear mean something: green for growth, red for love, brown for comfort, black for freedom. same works for nail polish, towels etc.\n• when you're happy, say “thank you” to nothing in particular\n• when you travel or explore, bring something local with you. it connects you with new places and makes sure you can return if you want", "createdAt": 1795388245929, "kind": "lista", "stage": "flor", "tags": ["superstições"], "title": "weird superstitions", "updatedAt": 1795388245929, "url": ""}, "g0008emnr": {"body": "• off your phone, connecting with real people, not thinking what you look like, not thinking of the body\n• more curious, explore more, go to places for the first time, say yes to everything\n• humbles you, makes you miss you people you love the most", "createdAt": 1795388261929, "kind": "pensamento", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["thoughts", "viagem"], "title": "feeling more yourself when traveling, why?", "updatedAt": 1795388261929, "url": ""}, "g00385n0h": {"body": "• OH LÁ LÁ\n• formosa hi-fi\n• CRN 932\n• elevado conselheiro\n• tan tan\n• kotchi", "createdAt": 1795388258929, "kind": "lugar", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["places", "são paulo", "bares"], "title": "Bares em São Paulo", "updatedAt": 1795388258929, "url": ""}, "g026j9ju7": {"body": "", "createdAt": 1795388235929, "kind": "link", "stage": "semente", "tags": ["cool websites"], "title": "Em Pauta — gerador de assuntos", "updatedAt": 1795388235929, "url": "https://empauta.co/"}, "g018u5fh9": {"body": "", "createdAt": 1795388243929, "kind": "link", "stage": "semente", "tags": ["cool websites"], "title": "Wiki Spy", "updatedAt": 1795388243929, "url": "https://neal.fun/wiki-spy/"}, "g038bsedu": {"body": "", "createdAt": 1795388223929, "kind": "link", "stage": "semente", "tags": ["articles"], "title": "How to engineer luck", "updatedAt": 1795388223929, "url": "https://substack.com/home/post/p-176236191"}, "g0333hjt7": {"body": "• ask a random and informative question (grocery store: do you know where the X product is?)\n• look it up", "createdAt": 1795388228929, "kind": "conselho", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["social"], "title": "how to find a person/meet someone - the socratic method", "updatedAt": 1795388228929, "url": ""}, "g0373ilmj": {"body": "", "createdAt": 1795388224929, "kind": "link", "stage": "semente", "tags": ["articles"], "title": "how to get smart again", "updatedAt": 1795388224929, "url": "https://substack.com/home/post/p-159524694"}, "g019ccliv": {"body": "", "createdAt": 1795388242929, "kind": "link", "stage": "semente", "tags": ["cool websites"], "title": "Marijana Pavlinić / Digital Stamp Collection", "updatedAt": 1795388242929, "url": "https://marijanapav.com/stamps"}, "g005hhw6p": {"body": "• rock climbing!!!\n• the artist way!!!\n• go to the library - mario de andrade\n• have a consistent moring routine\n• watch a movie before work\n• having a journaling ritual", "createdAt": 1795388256929, "kind": "lista", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["rotina"], "title": "activities", "updatedAt": 1795388256929, "url": ""}, "g030plas0": {"body": "• 60 min language study daily\n• read 5 pages\n• 5 min of speaking\n• 1 episode/yt video\n• journal\n• immerse yourself\n• track your study", "createdAt": 1795388231929, "kind": "lista", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["idiomas"], "title": "75 - fluent", "updatedAt": 1795388231929, "url": ""}, "g032pp5bc": {"body": "why not get suuuper cozy earlier and watch a movie?", "createdAt": 1795388229929, "kind": "pensamento", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["rotina"], "title": "bedtime routine", "updatedAt": 1795388229929, "url": ""}, "g0281z4bx": {"body": "", "createdAt": 1795388233929, "kind": "link", "stage": "semente", "tags": ["game"], "title": "murdle", "updatedAt": 1795388233929, "url": "https://murdle.com/"}, "g031sface": {"body": "trojan horse + bag with tiny greek soldiers", "createdAt": 1795388230929, "kind": "ideia", "stage": "semente", "tags": ["fantasia"], "title": "costume idea", "updatedAt": 1795388230929, "url": ""}, "g042ouyxf": {"body": "• are the washer and dryer dating or are they siblings?\n• would you rather object at every wedding you go to or take a selfie with the dead person at every funeral you go to?\n• would you rather always have crumbs in your bed or wet sleeves?\n• would you like to never have to sleep again or never have to use the bathroom again?", "createdAt": 1795388219929, "kind": "lista", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["social", "perguntas"], "title": "questions for coworkers", "updatedAt": 1795388219929, "url": ""}, "g015cz464": {"body": "• when you blow out your birthday cake candles or any candle\n• when you're standing or sitting between two people with the same name\n• when your eyelash falls out\n• repeating numbers on the clock\n• when you sneeze 4 times in a row\n• when you catch the moment when the streetlights come on or go out", "createdAt": 1795388246929, "kind": "lista", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["superstições"], "title": "things you can make a wish upon", "updatedAt": 1795388246929, "url": ""}, "g040axhxf": {"body": "• people like taking to me → ask better questions\n• listen → give my point early\n• feel like you understand → check if you understood them, repeat what they said\n• people trust you → follow through on the small things", "createdAt": 1795388221929, "kind": "conselho", "stage": "broto", "tags": ["social"], "title": "social chess", "updatedAt": 1795388221929, "url": ""}, "g002q56mr": {"body": "• never take criticism from someone you wouldn't take advice from\n• expect nothing, appreciate evertything\n• you miss 100% of the shots you don't take\n• nothing changes if nothing changes", "createdAt": 1795388259929, "kind": "conselho", "stage": "flor", "tags": ["advice"], "title": "advice", "updatedAt": 1795388259929, "url": ""}, "g024rfqpx": {"body": "", "createdAt": 1795388237929, "kind": "link", "stage": "semente", "tags": ["cool websites"], "title": "Moving Image Archive", "updatedAt": 1795388237929, "url": "https://www.movingimagearchive.com/"}, "g021qbdwq": {"body": "", "createdAt": 1795388240929, "kind": "link", "stage": "semente", "tags": ["cool websites"], "title": "weekend-mm-2026-pasticcino-bag-master.monogrid.io", "updatedAt": 1795388240929, "url